    "preamble": "State Of U.P. vs Sri Ram Surat Tripathi on 11 September, 2019 Author: Sudhir Agarwal Bench: Sudhir Agarwal High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 34 Case :- Criminal Revision No. - 1572 of 1996 Revisionist :- State Of U.P. Opposite Party :- Sri Ram Surat Tripathi Counsel for Revisionist :- A.G.A. Counsel for Opposite Party :- R. Shyam,Suresh Dhar Dwivedi Hon'ble Sudhir Agarwal,J. 1. Learned A.G.A. for State-revisionist and Sri Atul Kumar Singh, Advocate, holding brief of Sri Suresh Dhar Dwivedi, Advocate, appearing for respondent are present. 2. This criminal revision under Section 401 read with Section 397 Cr.P.C. has been filed aggrieved by order dated 21.05.1996 passed by 3rd Additional Sessions Judge, Farrukhabad discharging the respondent from the offence under Section 13(2) and 13(1)(C) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act.",
